    "updated_at": "2021-09-29T08:44:16Z",
    "body": "There's multiple things going on here.\r\n\r\n1. Implementations have a bug in that they do not enforce listing `Authorization` explicitly. This is being worked on by @yutakahirano, see https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/jEV2VMVjMt8/m/rogFnr6xAgAJ.\r\n2. It seems however that they might enforce this for the preflight cache? I think that would explain the results you are seeing above. Enabling credentials mode does not really matter I think as the side effect of that is that you have to list the header, which I suspect is what matters here.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
