    "created_at": "2022-01-20T06:14:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-01-20T06:14:22Z",
    "body": "I tried to ship the proposed behavior, but it's been [rejected](https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/yXxYCo3ytQU/m/03ytZCYUAgAJ) because the number of affected users is larger than expected.\r\n\r\nI can make more efforts to reduce the number of sites that depend on the current behavior (as discussed in the intent thread), but before that I want to re-check people's opinions on this. Mozilla failed to change the behavior, Chrome failed to change the behavior. Do we still want to change the behavior?\r\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
