    "updated_at": "2023-06-29T08:47:58Z",
    "body": "Looks like this spun off into an email thread and the issue here did not see the response it required.\r\n\r\nFirefox has this change [implemented behind a preference starting version 115](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1687364). Previous looks at observed behavior via https://chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/3873 seem to indicate that this anti-pattern has rather grown in popularity, which I find a bit worrying. \r\nIn summary, Firefox is happy to follow if this ends up being shipped in a coordinated way.",
